hadiths[40]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1726","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad ne hamein khabar di, Muhammad bin Amr se, Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman bin Auf se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main logon se us waqt tak ladta rahunga jab tak woh kahen: La ilaha illallah. Jab woh yeh keh den to unhon ne mujh se apne khoon aur apne maal bacha liye, magar haq ke sath, aur un ka hisab Allah Azza wa Jalla par hai."
"1727","[AI-translation] Abdul Aziz ne hamein khabar di, Muhammad bin Amr se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main logon se us waqt tak ladta rahunga jab tak woh kahen: La ilaha illallah. Jab woh yeh keh den to unhon ne mujh se apne khoon aur apne maal bacha liye, magar haq ke sath, aur un ka hisab Allah Ta'ala par hai."
"1728","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Sa'id bin Musayyab se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Kisra halaak ho jayega to us ke baad koi Kisra nahin hoga, aur jab Qaisar halaak ho jayega to us ke baad koi Qaisar nahin hoga. Qasam us Zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Un dono ke khazane zaroor Allah Ta'ala ke raaste mein kharch kiye jayenge. Pehli hadees Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees ke doosre hisse se, doosri Kitab Jirahul Amd se, aur teesri Kitab Jizyah se nikali."
"1729","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Dinar se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne farmaya: Jab yeh ayat nazil hui: Agar tum mein se bees sabr karne wale hon to woh do sau par ghalib aayenge (Al-Anfal: 65), to un par farz kar diya gaya ke bees do sau se na bhagen. Phir Allah Ta'ala ne nazil farmaya: Ab Allah ne tum se bojh halka kar diya aur use maloom hai ke tum mein kamzori hai. Pas agar tum mein se sau sabr karne wale hon to woh do sau par ghalib aayenge (Al-Anfal: 66). To un se bojh halka kar diya aur un par farz kar diya ke sau do sau se na bhagen."
"1730","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Abi Najeeh se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne farmaya: Jo teen se bhage woh nahin bhaga, aur jo do se bhage to woh bhag gaya. Pehli Kitab Jizyah se aur doosri Kitab Qitalul Mushrikeen se nikali."
"1731","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Yazid bin Abi Ziyad se, Abdur Rahman bin Abi Laila se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamein ek sarriyah mein bheja, hum dushman se mile aur log gabra kar titar-bitar ho gaye. Phir hum Madinah aaye aur us ka darwaza khola, aur hum ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hum bhagne wale hain. Aap ne farmaya: Balke tum laut kar dobara hamla karne wale ho aur main tumhari fiyah (panahgah) hun. Kitab Jizyah se nikali."
"1732","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Siqah rawi ne hamein khabar di, Muhammad bin Aban se, Alqamah bin Marsad se, Sulaiman bin Buraidah se, apne walid se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab koi lashkar bhejte to un par ek ameer muqarrar karte, aur farmate: Jab tum mushrikeen mein se apne dushman se milo to unhein teen khaslaton ya teen sifaton ki taraf bulao, Alqamah ko shak hua, unhein Islam ki taraf bulao, agar woh tumhari baat qubool kar len to un se qubool kar lo aur un se haath rok lo, phir unhein apne ghar se Muhajireen ke ghar ki taraf muntaqil hone ki dawat do, aur unhein batao ke agar woh aisa karen to un ke liye wohi hoga jo Muhajireen ke liye hai, aur un par wohi hoga jo un par hai, agar woh apne ghar mein rehne ko pasand karen to woh dehati Musalmanon ki tarah honge, un par Allah ka hukm jari hoga jaise Musalmanon par jari hota hai, aur un ke liye fai mein se kuch nahin magar yeh ke woh Musalmanon ke sath jihad karen, agar woh tumhein jawab na den to unhein apne haath se zaleel ho kar jizyah dene ki dawat do, agar woh aisa karen to un se qubool kar lo aur unhein chhod do, agar woh inkar karen to Allah Ta'ala se madad mango aur un se lado."
"1733","[AI-translation] Siqah rawi Yahya bin Hassan ne hamein khabar di, Muhammad bin Aban se, Alqamah bin Marsad se, Sulaiman bin Buraidah se, apne walid se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab koi lashkar bhejte to un par ek ameer muqarrar karte... phir hadees zikr ki. Pehli Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees ke doosre hisse se aur doosri Kitab Jizyah se nikali."
"1734","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Ibn Ka'b bin Malik se, apne chacha se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un logon ko jinhein Ibn Abil Huqaiq ki taraf bheja tha aurton aur bachon ko qatl karne se mana farmaya."
"1735","[AI-translation] Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Ibn Ka'b bin Malik se, apne chacha se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jab Ibn Abil Huqaiq ki taraf (lashkar) bheja to aurton aur bachon ko qatl karne se mana farmaya. Pehli Kitab Qitalul Mushrikeen se, aur woh us mein pehli hadees hai, aur doosri Kitab Risalah se nikali."
"1736","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utbah se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Sa'b bin Jassamah ne khabar di ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko mushrikeen ke ghar walon ke bare mein poocha jata hua suna jin par raat ko hamla kiya jata hai aur un ki aurton aur bachon ko nuqsan pahunchta hai, to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh unhi mein se hain. Aur Amr bin Dinar ne Zuhri se izafa kiya: Woh apne baapon mein se hain."
"1737","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Ubaidullah yani Ibn Abdullah se, Ibn Abbas se, Sa'b bin Jassamah Laisi se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se mushrikeen ke ghar walon ke bare mein poocha gaya jin par raat ko hamla kiya jata hai aur un ki aurton aur beton ko nuqsan pahunchta hai, to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh unhi mein se hain, aur kabhi Sufyan hadees mein kehte: Woh apne baapon mein se hain. Pehli Kitab Risalah se aur doosri Kitab Qitalul Mushrikeen se nikali."
"1738","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Saqafi ne hamein khabar di, Humaid se, Musa bin Anas bin Malik se: Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne un se poocha: Jab tum kisi sheher ka muhasra karte ho to kya karte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Hum ek aadmi ko sheher ki taraf bhejte hain aur us ke liye chamdon se ek dhaal bana dete hain, unhon ne farmaya: Tumhara kya khayal hai agar us par pathar phenka jaye? Unhon ne kaha: Tab woh qatl kar diya jayega, unhon ne farmaya: Aisa na karo, Qasam us Zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Mujhe yeh pasand nahin ke tum chaar hazaar ladne walon wale sheher ko ek Musalman ko zaya kar ke fatah karo."
"1739","[AI-translation] Saqafi ne hamein khabar di, Humaid se, Anas se, unhon ne farmaya: Hum ne Tustar ka muhasra kiya, to Hurmuzan Umar ke faisle par utar aaya, phir main use Umar ke paas laya, jab hum un ke paas pahunche to Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne us se farmaya: Baat karo, us ne kaha: Zinda ki baat karun ya murda ki baat, unhon ne farmaya: Baat karo, koi harj nahin. Us ne kaha: Hum aur tum, aye Arabon ki jamaat, jab tak Allah ne hamare aur tumhare darmiyan chhoda, hum tumhein ghulam banate the aur tumhein qatl karte the aur tumhein naraz karte the, phir jab Allah tumhare sath ho gaya to hamari tum par koi taqat na rahi. To Umar ne farmaya: Tum kya kehte ho? To main ne kaha: Aye Ameerul Momineen, main ne apne peeche bahut se dushman aur sakht quwwat chhodi hai, agar tum use qatl kar doge to qaum zindagi se mayoos ho jayegi aur is se un ki quwwat aur badh jayegi. To Umar ne farmaya: Kya main Bara bin Malik aur Majza'ah bin Saur ke qatil ko zinda chhod dun? Jab mujhe dar hua ke woh use qatl kar denge to main ne un se kaha: Us ke qatl ki koi gunjaish nahin, tum ne use kaha hai: Baat karo, koi harj nahin, to Umar ne farmaya: Tum ne rishwat li aur us se kuch hasil kiya. To main ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main ne na rishwat li aur na us se kuch hasil kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Tum apne gawahi par apne siva kisi aur ko zaroor laoge, warna main tumhein saza dene se shuru karunga. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir main nikla aur Zubair bin Awwam se mila, to unhon ne mere sath gawahi di, aur Umar ruk gaye, aur woh Musalman ho gaya aur Umar ne us ke liye wazifa muqarrar kiya. Dono hadeesein Kitab Asra wal Ghulool se nikali."
"1740","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Abdul Wahhab Saqafi ne hamein khabar di, Humaid se, Anas se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Khaibar ki taraf chale aur raat ko wahan pahunche, aur Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab raat ko kisi qaum par aate to subah hone tak un par hamla na karte, agar azan sunte to ruk jate, aur agar woh namaz padhne wale na hote to subah hote hi un par hamla karte, phir jab subah hui to Aap sawar hue aur Musalman bhi sawar hue, aur basti wale apne tokron aur phawdon ke sath nikle, jab unhon ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha to bole: Muhammad aur lashkar. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allahu Akbar, Khaibar tabah ho gaya, jab hum kisi qaum ke maidan mein utarte hain to daraye gaye logon ki subah buri hoti hai. Anas ne farmaya: Main Abu Talhah ke peeche sawar tha, aur mera qadam Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke qadam ko chhu raha tha. Kitab Asra wal Ghulool se nikali."
"1741","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Umar bin Habib ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Aun se: Nafi' ne unhein khat likh kar khabar di ke Ibn Umar ne unhein khabar di: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Bani Mustaliq par hamla kiya jab woh Muraisi' mein apne maweshiyon mein ghafil the, phir ladne walon ko qatl kiya aur aulaad ko qaidi banaya."
"1742","[AI-translation] Abu Damrah ne hamein khabar di, Musa bin Uqbah se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Bani Nadir ke amwal jala diye."
"1743","[AI-translation] Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Bani Nadir ke amwal jala diye, to ek kehne wale ne kaha: Bani Luayy ke sardaron par Buwairah mein phaili hui aag halki (mamuli baat) lagi."
"1744","[AI-translation] Anas bin Iyaz ne hamein khabar di, Musa bin Uqbah se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Bani Nadir ki khajooren kaat din aur jalaya, aur woh Buwairah hai."
"1745","[AI-translation] Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Bani Nadir ke amwal jala diye, to ek kehne wale ne kaha: Aur Bani Luayy ke sardaron par Buwairah mein phaili hui aag halki lagi."
"1746","[AI-translation] Hamare baaz ashab ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Ja'far Zuhri se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Ibn Shihab ko Urwah se, Usamah bin Zaid se hadees bayan karte suna, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe hukm diya ke main Ahl Ubna par subah ke waqt hamla karun aur jalaun. Yeh teenon hadeesein Kitab Qitalul Mushrikeen se, aur chhathi ke aakhir tak Kitab Asra wal Ghulool se nikali."
"1747","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Amr bin Sa'id se, Umar bin Kaseer bin Aflah se, Abu Muhammad maula Abu Qatadah se, Abu Qatadah Ansari se, unhon ne farmaya: Hum Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Hunain ke saal nikle. Jab hum mile to Musalmanon mein pehle ghabrahat phail gayi. Phir main ne mushrikeen mein se ek aadmi ko dekha jo ek Musalman par ghalib aa gaya tha. To main ghoom kar us ke peeche se aaya aur us ke kandhe ki rag par ek waar kiya. Phir woh meri taraf mutawajjeh hua aur mujhe itne zor se bheench liya ke mujhe us se maut ki boo aane lagi. Phir use maut aa gayi aur us ne mujhe chhod diya. Phir main Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se mila aur un se kaha: Logon ka kya haal hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Allah ka faisla. Phir log laut aaye, to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kisi maqtool ko qatl kare aur us par us ke paas daleel ho to us ka salb usi ka hoga. To main khada hua aur kaha: Mere liye kaun gawahi dega? Phir main baith gaya. Phir Aap ne doosri baar farmaya, to main khada hua aur kaha: Mere liye kaun gawahi dega? Phir main baith gaya. Phir Aap ne teesri baar farmaya, to main teesri baar khada hua. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aye Abu Qatadah, tumhein kya hai? To main ne Aap ko poora qissa sunaya. To qaum mein se ek aadmi ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool! Us ne sach kaha, aur us maqtool ka salb mere paas hai, to us ke badle use mujh se raazi kar den. To Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Nahin, Allah ki qasam! Agar aisa ho to hum Allah Ta'ala ke sheron mein se ek sher ki taraf jo Allah Ta'ala ke liye ladta hai aa kar us ka salb tumhein de den, to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ne sach kaha, use woh de do. Abu Qatadah ne farmaya: To us ne mujhe woh de diya, phir main ne zirah bech di aur Bani Salamah mein khajoor ka bagh khareed liya. Aur yeh pehla maal hai jo main ne Islam mein jama kiya. Malik ne farmaya: Mikhraf khajoor hai. Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i mein nikali."
"1748","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Yazid bin Khusaifah se, Sa'ib bin Yazid se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Uhud ke din do zirahein ek ke upar ek pehnin. Kitab Asra wal Ghulool se nikali."
"1749","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Hamare ashab mein se siqah rawi ne hamein khabar di, Ishaq Azraq Wasiti se, Ubaidullah bin Umar se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ghode ke liye do hisse aur sawar ke liye ek hissa muqarrar farmaya."
"1750","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Hisham bin Urwah se, Yahya bin Abbad bin Abdullah bin Zubair se: Zubair bin Awwam ghanimat mein se chaar hisse lete the: ek hissa apne liye aur do hisse apne ghode ke liye aur ek hissa qurbadaron mein. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Yani, wallahu a'lam, qurbadaron ke hisse se un ki walida Safiyyah ka hissa murad hai. Aur Sufyan ko shak hua, kya main ne ise Hisham se, Yahya se sun kar yaad kiya hai, aur Sufyan ko shak nahin ke woh Hisham ki hadees hai, Yahya se, na unhein aur na un mein se kisi aur ko jo ise Hisham se yaad karte hain."
"1751","[AI-translation] Mutarrif bin Mazin ne hamein khabar di, Ma'mar bin Rashid se, Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Muhammad bin Jubair bin Mut'im ne apne walid se khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Jab Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qurbadaron ka hissa Bani Hashim aur Bani Muttalib mein taqseem farmaya to main aur Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) Aap ke paas aaye. To hum ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, yeh hamare bhai Bani Hashim mein se hain; hum un ki fazilat ka inkar nahin karte, Aap ki us jagah ki wajah se jo Allah ne Aap ko un mein ata farmayi hai. Hamare Bani Muttalib wale bhaiyon ke bare mein Aap kya farmate hain: Aap ne unhein diya aur hamein chhod diya ya hamein rok diya, halanke hamari aur un ki qurbadari ek hai? To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bani Hashim aur Bani Muttalib ek hi cheez hain, isi tarah. Aur Aap ne ungliyon mein ungliyan dalin."
"1752","[AI-translation] Unhon ne hamein khabar di, mera khayal hai Dawood bin Abdur Rahman Attar hain, Ibn Mubarak se, Yunus se, Zuhri se, Jubair bin Mut'im se. Qazi Abu Bakr Hiri ne farmaya: Aur doosre nuskhe mein, Zuhri se, Ibn Musayyab se, Jubair bin Mut'im se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se usi mani ki tarah."
"1753","[AI-translation] Siqah rawi ne hamein khabar di, Muhammad bin Ishaq se, Ibn Shihab se, Sa'id bin Musayyab se, Jubair bin Mut'im se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se usi mani ki tarah. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Phir main ne yeh baat Mutarrif bin Mazin se zikr ki: Yunus aur Ibn Ishaq ne Ibn Shihab ki hadees Ibn Musayyab se riwayat ki. Unhon ne farmaya: Ma'mar ne hamein waisa hi hadees bayan ki jaisa main ne bayan kiya, to shayad Ibn Shihab ne ise dono se ek sath riwayat kiya hai."
"1754","[AI-translation] Mere chacha Muhammad bin Ali bin Shafi' ne hamein khabar di, Ali bin Husain se, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se usi ki tarah, aur izafa kiya: Allah lanat kare us par jo Bani Hashim aur Bani Muttalib mein tafreeq dale."
"1755","[AI-translation] Siqah rawi ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Ibn Musayyab se, Jubair bin Mut'im se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qurbadaron ka hissa Bani Hashim aur Bani Muttalib mein taqseem farmaya aur us mein se Bani Abd Shams aur Bani Naufal mein se kisi ko kuch na diya."
"1756","[AI-translation] Ibrahim bin Muhammad ne hamein khabar di, Matar Warraq aur ek aadmi se jis ka naam nahin liya, dono Hakam bin Utaibah se, Abdur Rahman bin Abi Laila se, unhon ne farmaya: Main Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se Ahjaruz Zait ke paas mila, to main ne un se kaha: Mere maan baap aap par qurban, Abu Bakr aur Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne khums mein se tum Ahl Bait ke haq mein kya kiya? To Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Raha Abu Bakr, Allah un par rehem kare, to un ke zamane mein akhmas (naya maal) nahin tha, aur jo tha woh unhon ne hamein poora ada kar diya. Aur rahe Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) to woh hamein dete rahe yahan tak ke un ke paas Sus aur Ahwaz ka maal aaya, ya farmaya: Ahwaz, ya farmaya: Faris, mujhe shak hai, yani Shafi'i ko. To unhon ne farmaya, Matar ki hadees mein ya doosre ki hadees mein, Musalmanon mein zaroorat hai, agar tum chaho to apna haq chhod do aur hum use Musalmanon ki zaroorat mein laga den yahan tak ke hamare paas maal aaye aur hum tumhara haq us mein se ada kar den, to Abbas ne Ali se kaha: Kya tum use hamare haq ki lalach dila rahe ho, to main ne un se kaha: Aye Abul Fazl! Kya hum Ameerul Momineen ko jawab dene aur Musalmanon ki zaroorat door karne ke ziyada haqdar nahin? Phir Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) wafaat pa gaye qabl is ke ke un ke paas maal aata aur woh hamein ada karte. Aur Hakam ne Matar aur doosre ki hadees mein farmaya: Umar ne farmaya: Tumhara haq hai: aur mujhe maloom nahin jab woh zyada ho jaye ke kya woh sab tumhara hai, agar tum chaho to main tumhein us mein se utna dunga jitna main tumhare liye samjhun, to hum ne un se poora lene ke siva inkar kiya aur unhon ne hamein dene se inkar kiya."
"1757","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Dinar se, Zuhri se, Malik bin Aus se: Umar ne farmaya: Koi shakhs aisa nahin magar is maal mein us ka haq hai, use diya gaya ho ya roka gaya ho, sivae un ke jo tumhare dayen haath malik hain."
"1758","[AI-translation] Ibrahim bin Muhammad ne hamein khabar di, Muhammad bin Munkadir se, Malik bin Aus se, Umar se usi ki tarah, aur farmaya: Agar main zinda raha to Sarw Himyar ke charwahe tak us ka haq pahunch jayega. Yeh das hadeesein aur Shafi'i ke qaul Kitab Qismatil Fai se nikali."
"1759","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Najd ki taraf ek sarriyah bheja jis mein Abdullah bin Umar the. Phir unhein bahut se oont ghanimat mein mile. To un ke hisse barah oont ya gyarah oont the, phir unhein ek ek oont izafi diya gaya. Kitab Qismatil Fai se nikali."
"1760","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Ubaidullah bin Umar se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne Uhud ke saal pesh kiya gaya, aur main chaudah saal ka tha to Aap ne mujhe lautaa diya. Phir mujhe Aap ke samne Khandaq ke saal pesh kiya gaya aur main pandrah saal ka tha to Aap ne mujhe ijazat de di. Nafi' ne farmaya: Phir main ne yeh hadees Umar bin Abdul Aziz ko sunayi, to unhon ne farmaya: Yeh ladne walon aur aulaad ke darmiyan farq hai. Aur unhon ne likha ke pandrah saal wale ke liye ladne walon mein wazifa muqarrar kiya jaye, aur jo is umr ko na pahunche use aulaad mein shumar kiya jaye. Kitab Qismatil Fai se nikali."
"1761","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Ibn Uyainah ko Zuhri se hadees bayan karte suna: Unhon ne Malik bin Aus bin Hadsan ko kehte suna: Main ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ko suna, aur Abbas aur Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke amwal mein un se jhagad rahe the, to Umar ne farmaya: Bani Nadir ke amwal us mein se the jo Allah ne apne Rasool ko fai ke taur par ata farmaya jis par Musalmanon ne ghode aur oont nahin daudaye. To woh Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye khaas tha, Musalmanon se alag. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) us mein se apne ghar walon ko saal bhar ka kharch dete, jo bach jata use ghode aur hathyar mein Allah Ta'ala ke raaste mein tayyari ke taur par lagate, phir Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) wafaat pa gaye to Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziyallahu anhu) us ke mutawalli bane waisa hi jaisa Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) us ke mutawalli bane the, phir main us ka mutawalli bana waisa hi jaisa Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Abu Bakr us ke mutawalli bane the, phir tum dono ne mujh se manga ke main tum dono ko us ka mutawalli bana dun, to main ne tum dono ko us ka mutawalli bana diya is shart par ke tum dono us mein waisa hi amal karoge jaisa Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Abu Bakr ne amal kiya. Phir tum dono mere paas jhagadte hue aaye ho. Kya tum dono chahte ho ke main tum mein se har ek ko aadha de dun? Kya tum dono mujh se pehle faisle ke siva koi aur faisla chahte ho? To nahin, Qasam us Zaat ki jis ke izn se aasman aur zameen qayam hain, main tumhare darmiyan us ke siva koi faisla nahin karunga. Agar tum dono us se aajiz ho to use mere supurd kar do, main tumhein us se kifayat karunga. Shafi'i ne farmaya: To Sufyan ne mujh se kaha: Main ne ise Zuhri se nahin suna, aur shayad Amr bin Dinar ne mujhe Zuhri se khabar di. Main ne kaha: Jaisa tum ne qissa bayan kiya? Unhon ne farmaya: Han. Kitab Qismatil Fai se nikali."
"1762","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Muhammad bin Munkadir se, Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar mere paas Bahrain ka maal aaye to main tumhein aise aur aise dunga. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) wafaat pa gaye aur woh Aap ke paas na aaya. Phir woh Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aaya, to unhon ne mujhe diya jab woh un ke paas aaya. Rabi' ne farmaya: Hadees ka baqiya hissa, Agar mere paas aaye... se, mujhe Shafi'i ke siva kisi ne hadees bayan nahin ki. Kitab Qismatil Fai se nikali."
"1763","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad ne hamein khabar di, Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se, Yazid bin Hurmuz se: Najdah ne Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ko khat likha: Kya Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aurton ko sath lekar jang karte the? Aur kya un ke liye hissa muqarrar karte the? To unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aurton ko sath lekar jang karte the aur woh zakhmiyon ki marham-patti karti thin, aur un ke liye hissa muqarrar na karte the, lekin unhein ghanimat mein se kuch dete the."
"1764","[AI-translation] Hatim bin Ismail ne hamein khabar di, Ja'far yani Ibn Muhammad se, apne walid se, Yazid bin Hurmuz se: Najdah ne Ibn Abbas ko chand baton ke bare mein poochte hue khat likha. To Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Log kehte hain: Ibn Abbas Haruriyah se khato-kitabat karte hain, aur agar mujhe ilm chhupane ka dar na hota to main use khat na likhta, phir Najdah ne unhein likha: Amma ba'd, mujhe khabar den: Kya Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aurton ko sath lekar jang karte the? Aur kya un ke liye hissa muqarrar karte the? Aur kya woh bachon ko qatl karte the? Aur yateem ki yateemi kab khatm hoti hai? Aur khums kis ke liye hai? To Ibn Abbas ne unhein likha: Tum ne mujhe likh kar poocha: Kya Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aurton ko sath lekar jang karte the? Aur woh unhein sath lekar jang karte the aur woh mareezon ki marham-patti karti thin aur unhein ghanimat mein se diya jata tha. Aur rahe hissa to un ke liye hissa muqarrar na farmaya, aur Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne bachon ko qatl na farmaya, to tum bhi unhein qatl na karo, magar yeh ke tum un mein se woh jante ho jo Khidr ne us ladke ke bare mein jana tha jise qatl kiya gaya, phir momin aur kafir mein farq karo, to kafir ko qatl karo aur momin ko chhod do. Aur tum ne likha ke yateem ki yateemi kab khatm hoti hai? Meri umr ki qasam! Aadmi ki dadhi safed ho jati hai halanke woh lene mein kamzor aur dene mein kamzor hota hai, phir jab woh apne liye us bhale tareeqe se le jaisa log lete hain to us se yateemi khatm ho gayi. Aur tum ne khums ke bare mein poochte hue likha, to hum kehte hain woh hamara hai, lekin hamari qaum ne hum par is ka inkar kiya to hum ne us par sabr kiya. Pehli Kitab Jizyah se, aur woh us mein pehli hadees hai, aur doosri Kitab Asra wal Ghulool se nikali."
"1765","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Siqah rawi ne hamein khabar di, Ismail bin Abi Khalid se, Qais se, Jarir se, unhon ne farmaya: Bajilah logon ka chautha hissa the, to un ke liye Sawad ka chautha hissa taqseem kiya gaya. Phir unhon ne teen ya chaar saal istefada kiya, mujhe shak hua, phir main Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aaya, aur mere sath fulanah bint fulan, un mein se ek aurat thi jis ka naam unhon ne liya tha; mujhe us ke naam ka zikr yaad nahin. To Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Agar main taqseem karne wala zimmedar na hota to main tumhein us par chhod deta jo tumhare liye taqseem kiya gaya, lekin main samajhta hun ke tum logon ko wapas karo. Kitab Siyar ala Siyar Waqidi se nikali, aur woh us mein pehli hadees hai."
